          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-meta">
              <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2025-09">Sep 2025 — Present</time>
              <span class="timeline-org">Fortunesoft IT Innovations · Bengaluru · On-Site</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Business Analyst & Product Designer</h3>
            <p class="timeline-org">Fortunesoft IT Innovations · Bengaluru · On-Site</p>
            <p>Translating complex requirements into actionable solutions for FinTech, Healthcare and Life Sciences. Leading requirements, Jira workflows, wireframes, and change-request management on two fintech platforms: Horizon (live) and Adapter (UAT).</p>
            <ul class="timeline-highlights">
              <li>~1,000 investors migrated on Horizon</li>
              <li>12 months kickoff → production</li>
              <li>3 change requests delivered</li>
            </ul>
