        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-meta">
              <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2022-11">Nov 2022 – Jan 2025</time>
              <span class="timeline-org">Siggraph BNMIT · Student Club · On-Site</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Brand Development Lead</h3>
            <p class="timeline-org">Siggraph BNMIT · Student Club · On-Site</p>
            <p>Grew social media by 200%, launched successful merchandise, organized major events to scale the club.</p>
