          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-meta">
              <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2023-06">Jun 2023 – Jul 2024</time>
              <span class="timeline-org">IEEE CAS Bangalore · Remote</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Web Developer</h3>
            <p class="timeline-org">IEEE CAS Bangalore · Remote</p>
            <p>Created and optimized WordPress pages, managing content and improving website accessibility.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-meta">
              <time class="timeline-date" datetime="2023-09">Sep – Oct 2023</time>
              <span class="timeline-org">Subhanu Technologies & Solutions Pvt. Ltd. · On-Site</span>
            </div>
